32	- Equating Steinberg top classes in degree 2g-2=10 with fundamental classes of maximal simplices of the curve complex. [reason: Dimension mismatch: the Steinberg module is the top reduced homology of the curve complex in degree 2g-2, while maximal simplices of the curve complex have dimension 3g-4=14 for g=6, not 2g-2.]
